-- (2026-11-14) σ extended by a cube V of values over tot-base (sub-ext2): the vertex cube is sub-ext-S's
-- (the pull of V along sub-tot, its vertex map ext-gS), its path ext-path and then map-pull-i (the
-- pull's contexts are sub-tot's, pointwise judgmentally; ext-kT), which replaces sub-ext-tail. Its
-- action on ext-liftG is the pull of V with the lift's function (subM-ext): carry-uniq with ext-D and
-- lift-pull-i, then pull-liftp.
ext-gS : (sk' sk : Lst Entry) (a : TyShape) (Y : Type 1) (h : Y → Sem a) (γ' : CtxV sk') (t : SubT sk' sk Y γ') →
  ExtV sk' sk a Y (λ γ e ρ → h (e ρ)) (γ' , t) → SubF sk' (lcons (e-ty a) sk) γ'
ext-gS sk' sk a Y h γ' t v = ((fst (fst t) , λ ρ → h (snd t ρ)) , λ ρ' → (snd (fst t) ρ' , v ρ'))
ext-kT : (sk' sk : Lst Entry) (a : TyShape) (Y : Type 1) (h : Y → Sem a) (γ' : CtxV sk') → SubT sk' sk Y γ' → CtxV (lcons (e-ty a) sk)
ext-kT sk' sk a Y h γ' t = (fst (fst t) , λ ρ → h (snd t ρ))
